    "Some games warn about “third-party libraries” (d3d11.dll, dxgi.dll) next to their executable: those are MacHub's graphics layer. The warning is safe to dismiss.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Certains jeux signalent des « bibliothèques tierces » (d3d11.dll, dxgi.dll) à côté de leur exécutable : c'est la couche graphique de MacHub. Tu peux ignorer cet avertissement sans risque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some items couldn't be moved to the Trash:": {
