    },
    "Steam connected · Steam account settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam connecté · Réglages du compte Steam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam couldn't be reached to confirm the sign-in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam est injoignable pour confirmer la connexion."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サインインの確認のために Steam に接続できませんでした。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法连接 Steam 以确认登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam did not confirm this sign-in. Please try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam n'a pas confirmé cette connexion. Réessayez."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam がこのサインインを確認しませんでした。もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 未确认此次登录，请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Mac downloads it. Update Now starts it right away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Mac la télécharge. « Mettre à jour maintenant » la lance tout de suite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Windows and games keep running if MacHub quits without them. Quitting them closes Steam properly first (cloud saves sync), then ends anything left.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Windows et les jeux continuent de tourner si MacHub se ferme sans eux. Les quitter ferme d'abord Steam proprement (les sauvegardes cloud se synchronisent), puis termine ce qui reste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Windows and its games": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Windows et ses jeux"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Windows couldn't be set up": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Windows n'a pas pu être installé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Windows didn't start within 2 minutes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Windows n'a pas démarré en 2 minutes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Windows in a bottle": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Windows dans une bouteille"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ボトル内の Windows 版 Steam"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "容器中的 Windows 版 Steam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Windows is still running. Quit it, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Windows tourne encore. Quitte-le, puis réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Windows isn't installed in the bottle “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Windows n'est pas installé dans la bouteille « %@ »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Windows or a game is still running. Left open, they keep using memory and can end up frozen in a black window once MacHub is gone. Steam is closed properly first, so your cloud saves sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Windows ou un jeu tourne encore. Laissés ouverts, ils continuent d'utiliser de la mémoire et peuvent finir figés dans une fenêtre noire une fois MacHub fermé. Steam est d'abord fermé proprement, pour que tes sauvegardes cloud se synchronisent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Windows was asked to install this game in the bottle. Follow the download in Steam.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Windows a reçu la demande d'installer ce jeu dans la bouteille. Suivez le téléchargement dans Steam."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ボトル内の Windows 版 Steam にこのゲームのインストールを依頼しました。ダウンロードは Steam で確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已请求容器中的 Windows 版 Steam 安装此游戏。请在 Steam 中查看下载进度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam for Windows was asked to install this game. Confirm the install in Steam's window; MacHub follows the download.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam pour Windows a reçu la demande d'installer ce jeu. Confirme l'installation dans la fenêtre de Steam ; MacHub suit le téléchargement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has a native macOS version: play it with Steam for Mac, without Wine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam propose une version macOS native : joue avec Steam pour Mac, sans Wine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam has no store page for this title in your region.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam ne propose pas de fiche pour ce titre dans votre région."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "お住まいの地域では、このタイトルの Steam ストアページはありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你所在的地区，Steam 没有此内容的商店页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is limiting requests right now. The store rows will come back in a few minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam limite les requêtes en ce moment. Les rangées du Store reviendront dans quelques minutes."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在 Steam がリクエストを制限しています。ストアの行は数分で戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 当前正在限制请求，商店内容将在几分钟后恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is limiting requests right now. Try again in a few minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam limite les requêtes en ce moment. Réessayez dans quelques minutes."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在 Steam がリクエストを制限しています。数分後にもう一度お試しください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 当前正在限制请求，请几分钟后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is running. Sign in in Steam's own window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam est lancé. Connecte-toi dans la fenêtre de Steam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is uninstalling this game…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam désinstalle ce jeu…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is updating this game": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam met ce jeu à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is updating this game. Play starts it once the update is done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam met à jour ce jeu. Jouer le lancera une fois la mise à jour terminée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam is verifying the game's files…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam vérifie les fichiers du jeu…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam only shares the list of games you own through its official Web API, which needs your personal key. Sign-in itself doesn't need it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam ne partage la liste de vos jeux que via son Web API officielle, qui nécessite votre clé personnelle. La connexion elle-même n'en a pas besoin."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam は所有ゲームの一覧を公式 Web API 経由でのみ提供しており、個人用キーが必要です。サインイン自体には不要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 只通过官方 Web API 提供你拥有的游戏列表，这需要你的个人密钥。登录本身不需要它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam page": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Page Steam"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam ページ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 页面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam privacy settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Confidentialité Steam"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam のプライバシー設定"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 隐私设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam received the launch request. MacHub doesn't check yet whether the game window opened.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam a reçu la demande de lancement. MacHub ne vérifie pas encore si la fenêtre du jeu s'est ouverte."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam が起動リクエストを受け取りました。ゲームウィンドウが開いたかどうかは、まだ MacHub では確認していません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 已收到启动请求。MacHub 目前还不会检查游戏窗口是否已打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam received the launch request. MacHub is watching for the game's own process…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam a reçu la demande de lancement. MacHub guette le processus du jeu…"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam が起動リクエストを受け取りました。MacHub がゲームのプロセスを確認しています…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 已收到启动请求。MacHub 正在等待游戏进程出现…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam received the request. MacHub is watching for the game's own process.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam a reçu la demande. MacHub guette le processus du jeu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam refused the Web API key. Check or replace it in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam a refusé la clé Web API. Vérifiez-la ou remplacez-la dans les Réglages."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam が Web API キーを拒否しました。設定で確認または変更してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 拒绝了 Web API 密钥。请在设置中检查或更换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam returned no games: your profile's “Game details” are private. Make them public in Steam's privacy settings, then refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam n'a renvoyé aucun jeu : les « Détails des jeux » de votre profil sont privés. Rendez-les publics dans la confidentialité Steam, puis actualisez."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam からゲームが返されませんでした。プロフィールの「ゲームの詳細」が非公開です。Steam のプライバシー設定で公開にしてから更新してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 没有返回任何游戏：你资料中的“游戏详情”为私密。请在 Steam 隐私设置中设为公开，然后刷新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam rewrites its list of library folders when it quits, so MacHub can only add one while Steam is closed. Steam saves your cloud saves on the way out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam réécrit sa liste de dossiers de bibliothèque en quittant, donc MacHub ne peut en ajouter un que lorsque Steam est fermé. Steam synchronise tes sauvegardes cloud en partant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam sells a Mac build of this game: Steam for Mac runs it without Whisky.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam vend une version Mac de ce jeu : Steam pour Mac le lance sans Whisky."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam はこのゲームの Mac 版を販売しています。Mac 版 Steam なら Whisky なしで起動できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 出售此游戏的 Mac 版本：Mac 版 Steam 无需 Whisky 即可运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam sells a Mac build of this game: Steam for Mac runs it without Wine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam vend une version Mac de ce jeu : Steam pour Mac la lance sans Wine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam sells a Mac build of this game: install Steam for Mac to run it without Wine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam vend une version Mac de ce jeu : installe Steam pour Mac pour la lancer sans Wine."
          }
        }
      }
