          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine is built for Intel processors and runs through Rosetta 2, Apple's translator. Install it once by running this command in Terminal, then check again:": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine est conçu pour les processeurs Intel et passe par Rosetta 2, le traducteur d'Apple. Installe-le une fois en lançant cette commande dans Terminal, puis vérifie à nouveau :"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine is opening the program.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine ouvre le programme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine is preparing Windows in the bottle…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine prépare Windows dans la bouteille…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine log": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Journal de Wine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine logs": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Journaux de Wine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine reports (ProtonDB)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rapports Wine (ProtonDB)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine runtime": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moteur Wine"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine ランタイム"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine 运行环境"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine stopped with code %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine s'est arrêté avec le code %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wine's own renderer over OpenGL: for DirectX 9 and older games.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le rendu de Wine via OpenGL : pour les jeux DirectX 9 et plus anciens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a game file": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans fichier de jeu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a key, MacHub reads your library from Steam for Windows on this Mac once you are signed in there (games shared through Steam Families included). A personal key from steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey (for the domain, “localhost” is fine) adds playtime and the games Steam for Windows hasn't shown yet. MacHub keeps it in the macOS Keychain only and never writes it to files or logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans clé, MacHub lit ta bibliothèque depuis Steam pour Windows sur ce Mac dès que tu y es connecté (jeux partagés via les Familles Steam compris). Une clé personnelle sur steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey (pour le domaine, « localhost » convient) ajoute le temps de jeu et les jeux que Steam pour Windows n'a pas encore affichés. MacHub la garde uniquement dans le Trousseau macOS et ne l'écrit jamais dans des fichiers ou des journaux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without changing this, Finder's Open With menu still offers MacHub, and you can drag files onto its window. MacHub never runs a file before you confirm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans rien changer ici, le menu Ouvrir avec du Finder propose quand même MacHub, et tu peux glisser des fichiers sur sa fenêtre. MacHub n'exécute jamais un fichier avant ta confirmation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Won't run": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ne fonctionne pas"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "動作しません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write C:\\%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrire C:\\%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write dxvk.conf next to %@ (not found in the game's folder).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrire dxvk.conf à côté de %@ (introuvable dans le dossier du jeu)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing registry settings…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écriture des réglages du registre…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Xbox Wireless Controller": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manette sans fil Xbox"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also drag a .exe or .msi onto this window, or use Open With > MacHub in Finder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux aussi glisser un .exe ou un .msi sur cette fenêtre, ou utiliser Ouvrir avec > MacHub dans le Finder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as la %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Steam library": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre bibliothèque Steam"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam ライブラリ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Steam 游戏库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Whisky is too old for MacHub. Install the maintained fork (frankea/Whisky).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre Whisky est trop ancien pour MacHub. Installez le fork maintenu (frankea/Whisky)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "お使いの Whisky は MacHub には古すぎます。保守されているフォーク (frankea/Whisky) をインストールしてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Whisky 版本过旧，无法用于 MacHub。请安装仍在维护的分支 (frankea/Whisky)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your game details are private on Steam.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos détails de jeux sont privés sur Steam."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam でゲームの詳細が非公開になっています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在 Steam 上的游戏详情为私密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your library is empty": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre bibliothèque est vide"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ライブラリは空です"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的游戏库为空"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own games": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes propres jeux"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your personal API key lets MacHub list a mod's files and download them with your account. It stays in the macOS Keychain. Free accounts click “Mod Manager Download” on the mod's page and MacHub installs the file; Premium accounts download directly from MacHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta clé API personnelle permet à MacHub de lister les fichiers d'un mod et de les télécharger avec ton compte. Elle reste dans le Trousseau macOS. Avec un compte gratuit, clique sur « Mod Manager Download » sur la page du mod et MacHub installe le fichier ; un compte Premium télécharge directement depuis MacHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your report helps other Mac players know what works. MacHub fills in the details; you review and post it on GitHub with your own account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton rapport aide les autres joueurs Mac à savoir ce qui marche. MacHub remplit les détails ; tu relis et tu publies sur GitHub avec ton propre compte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your sign-in is valid, but this account has no Steam Community profile yet, so Steam publishes no name or avatar. Optional: set one up on Steam.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta connexion est valide, mais ce compte n'a pas encore de profil Communauté Steam : Steam ne publie donc ni nom ni avatar. Facultatif : configure-le sur Steam."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サインインは有効ですが、このアカウントにはまだ Steam コミュニティのプロフィールがないため、名前やアバターは公開されていません。任意で Steam で設定できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录有效，但此账户还没有 Steam 社区资料，因此 Steam 不会公开名称或头像。可选：在 Steam 上设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "by %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "par %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "drive_c is missing after wineboot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "drive_c est absent après wineboot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "esync": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "esync"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "from %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "depuis %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "highball-db has no recipe for this game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "highball-db n'a pas de recette pour ce jeu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS couldn't sign the shortcut: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS n'a pas pu signer le raccourci : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS didn't let MacHub open it. Check that it's fully downloaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS n'a pas laissé MacHub l'ouvrir. Vérifie qu'il est entièrement téléchargé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS has no volume per app of its own. MacHub captures the sound of an app you turn down and plays it at the level you choose; macOS asks once for permission to record other apps' audio. Nothing is recorded or saved. A browser counts as one app: a YouTube video follows the browser's volume, since macOS doesn't separate tabs. Volumes apply while MacHub is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS n'a pas de volume par application. MacHub capte le son d'une app que tu baisses et le rejoue au niveau choisi ; macOS demande une fois l'autorisation d'enregistrer l'audio des autres apps. Rien n'est enregistré ni conservé. Un navigateur compte comme une seule app : une vidéo YouTube suit le volume du navigateur, car macOS ne sépare pas les onglets. Les volumes s'appliquent tant que MacHub est ouvert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS refused to adjust this app's sound. Check that MacHub may record audio in System Settings › Privacy & Security.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS a refusé de régler le son de cette app. Vérifie que MacHub peut enregistrer l'audio dans Réglages Système › Confidentialité et sécurité."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "msync": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "msync"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "msync (fastest)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "msync (le plus rapide)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "replaces an existing folder (kept as a backup)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "remplace un dossier existant (gardé en sauvegarde)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "wineboot -u: refreshes Windows's own files for the current engine. Your programs and saves stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "wineboot -u : actualise les fichiers de Windows pour le moteur actuel. Tes programmes et sauvegardes restent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "·": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "· disabled": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· désactivé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· required by another mod": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· requis par un autre mod"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}